WEBVTT

00:01:29.771 --> 00:01:31.541
we have 324 boys.

00:01:31.565 --> 00:01:35.141
And by the way, all of these numbers
are significantly higher

00:01:35.165 --> 00:01:36.585
if you happen to be black,

00:01:36.609 --> 00:01:38.452
if you happen to be poor,

00:01:38.476 --> 00:01:41.000
if you happen to exist
in an overcrowded school.

00:01:42.249 --> 00:01:44.370
And if you are a boy,

00:01:44.394 --> 00:01:48.130
you're four times as likely
to be diagnosed with ADHD --

00:01:48.154 --> 00:01:50.615
Attention Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder.

00:01:51.079 --> 00:01:54.140
Now there is another side to this.

00:01:54.164 --> 00:01:59.774
And it is important that we recognize
that women still need help in school,

00:01:59.798 --> 00:02:02.061
that salaries are still
significantly lower,